%% Request flow: internal steps as notes, not self-messages, so labels do not cross lifelines.
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Client
  participant S as Service
  participant P as Provider

  C->>S: POST /jobs
  Note over S: validate input, load session
  S->>P: create job
  P-->>S: job id
  Note over S: store job, emit event
  S-->>C: 202 Accepted (job id)
